1013	  // This is the ONE place a VPS order is definitively created & paid: both the wallet
1014	  // path (lib/actions.ts payAndDeploy) and the card path (lib/fulfil-checkout.ts, run
1015	  // by the Stripe webhook or the success redirect) reach it, so recording here counts
1016	  // every completed VPS deploy exactly once, with a reliable `userId`. The step index
1017	  // orders it at the tail (after Review/Payment); the completion is a terminal event,
1018	  // not a wizard step, so it drives the completed counts rather than rendering a row.
1019	  // Best-effort AND double-guarded: `recordDeployFunnelComplete` already swallows every
1020	  // failure, and the extra catch guarantees analytics can never disturb the money path.
1021	  try {
