1027	  // the money has already moved, so a mail failure must NEVER surface as an order
1028	  // failure. Fires exactly once per order (single commit) and covers BOTH the wallet
1029	  // path (lib/actions.ts) and the card path (lib/fulfil-checkout.ts) because both go
1030	  // through this one placeOrder. This is the invoice DOCUMENT — deliberately
